# Wear / Update / Auth improve loops

When changing Wear, in-app Update, login, or watch-pair:

1. Run the matching domain via `python scripts/improve_loop_runner.py <wear|update|auth>`
2. Read that domain’s `improve_summary_latest.json` + `training_lessons.json`
3. Fix score failures; append lessons; expand cases

Key gates: Wear redeems only; phone creates codes; Windows Update needs Setup.exe;
Wear≠Android APK; no service_role / Make webhook in clients.
